 opfStateExtended,\n    opfScalarClosures,\n    opfOperators,\n    \
printTestResult\n  }\n|>;\n\nopfPotentialFunctions = <|\n  \
\"GeometricExtensions\" -> {\n    anisotropyProjector,\n    \
